#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to update your project so that it works with Qiskit 1.0."
msgstr "Cara mengemas kini projek anda supaya ia berfungsi dengan Qiskit 1.0."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit 1.0 migration guide"
msgstr "Panduan migrasi Qiskit 1.0"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit 1.0 migration guide {#qiskit-10-migration-guide}"
msgstr "Panduan migrasi Qiskit 1.0 {#qiskit-10-migration-guide}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit 1.0 brings new stability guarantees and performance improvements, but it\n"
"does break compatibility with all previous versions of Qiskit. See the\n"
"following guides on updating your environment and code to work with Qiskit v1.0.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit 1.0 membawa jaminan kestabilan baharu dan peningkatan prestasi, tetapi ia\n"
"memecahkan keserasian dengan semua versi Qiskit sebelumnya. Lihat\n"
"panduan berikut tentang mengemas kini persekitaran dan kod anda untuk berfungsi dengan Qiskit v1.0.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Install the new Qiskit v1.0 package](/guides/qiskit-1.0-installation) for "
"upgrading Python environments and project dependencies.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Pasang pakej Qiskit v1.0 baharu](/guides/qiskit-1.0-installation) untuk "
"menaik taraf persekitaran Python dan kebergantungan projek.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Qiskit v1.0 feature changes](/guides/qiskit-1.0-features) for updating your"
" code.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Perubahan ciri Qiskit v1.0](/guides/qiskit-1.0-features) untuk mengemas "
"kini kod anda.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Breaking package changes of Qiskit v1.0](/guides/metapackage-migration) to "
"understand the new and old package structure.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Perubahan pakej yang memecah dalam Qiskit v1.0](/guides/metapackage-"
"migration) untuk memahami struktur pakej baharu dan lama.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read more about the benefits of Qiskit v1.0 on the [IBM&reg; "
"blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-1-0-release-summary).\n"
msgstr ""
"Baca lebih lanjut tentang manfaat Qiskit v1.0 di [blog "
"IBM&reg;](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-1-0-release-summary).\n"
